      "Microscopy Image Browser: A platform for segmentation and analysis of multidimensional datasets I. Belevich, M. Joensuu, D. Kumar, H. Vihinen and E. Jokitalo PLoS Biology 2016 Jan 4;14(1):e1002340. doi: 10.1371/journal.pbio.1002340"
